  "uprn": "100021562131",
  "decision_date": "19/07/2010",
  "description": "Retention of two storey building with accommodation in the roof space comprising three two-bedroom and two one-bedroom self-contained flats with associated parking and landscaping",
  "site_name": "35",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "15/04/2008",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": "Sutton Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "lapsed_date": "18/07/2013",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - Within three months of the date of this permission a scheme for protecting the proposed residential accommodation from excessive external noise shall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority for approval and any works which form part of such a scheme shall be completed within three months of such an approval.",
    "Condition : 4 - Within three months of the date of this permission a plan indicating the positions, design, materials and type of boundary treatment, including arrangements to secure the privacy of the occupiers of the ground floor flats to be erected shall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority for approval.  The boundary treatment shall be completed within three months of the date of any such approval.",
    "Condition : 5 - Within three months of the date of this permission a detailed planting schedule for the landscaping layout hereby approved and a scheme for the maintenance of that planting for a period of five years shall be submitted to the Local Planning Authority for approval.  The planting so approved shall be completed in the first available planting season following the date of any such approval and the maintenance programme put into effect.  Any plants which die within the first five years following approval shall be replaced and maintained in accordance with the maintenance schedule.",
    "Condition : 6 - Within three months of the date of this permission the refuse storage shown on the drawings hereby approved shall be put in place and shall be permanently retained thereafter.",
    "Condition : 7 - No additional windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the flank of the building.",
    "Condition : 8 - No obstructions to visibility exceeding 0.6 metres above ground level shall be installed on site within a visibility splay 2.4 metres deep and 2.4 metres wide either side of the vehicle access to Sutton Road.",
    "Condition : 9 - Within three months of the date of this permission, the internal alterations to the second floor flat that would convert it from a two-bedroom flat to a one-bedroom flat as shown on drawing number 05103-100 rev B received: 09 March 2010 shall be carried out in full.  This arrangement shall be permanently retained thereafter."
  ],
